 0-½ ton class was an all-French event over two rounds on the short course, together approximately 8 km. A maximum of three crew members were allowed. Race One was a fairly close one, with the yacht “Baby” of " [:a {:href "/athletes/62123"} "Pierre Gervais"] " beating " [:a {:href "/athletes/63889"} "François Texier"] "’s “Quand-Même” by less than three minutes. The next finisher, “Sarcelle” with " [:a {:href "/athletes/63046"} "Henri Monnot"] ", trailed the top yachts by more than 11 minutes."] "\n\n" [:p {} "There were 11 boats entered but only seven started the race. Prizes given were as follows: 1st – 600 francs; 2nd – 400 francs; 3rd – 250 francs; 4th – 100 francs; and 5th – 50 francs."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Adjusted Time"] [:th {} "Actual Time"] [:th {} "Handicap"] [:th {} "Weight"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Baby"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "1-06:16"] [:td {} "1-01:52"] [:td {} "4:24"] [:td {} "0.50 tons"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "12"} [:a {:href "/athletes/62123"} "Pierre Gervais"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "Quand-Même"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "1-08:54"] [:td {} "1-04:32"] [:td {} "4:24"] [:td {} "0.50 tons"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "12"} [:a {:href "/athletes/63889"} "François Texier"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/63890"} "Auguste Texier"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/62796"} "Rober